      <h2>How to Use the Cash-on-Cash Return Calculator</h2>
      <p>Follow these 5 simple steps to calculate your <strong>cash-on-cash return</strong> and determine if a real estate investment is worth your money. This free calculator works for <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/real-estate/rental-yield-calculator">rental properties</a>, <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/real-estate/cap-rate-calculator">multifamily deals</a>, and <a href="<%= baseUrl %>/loan-calculators/fha-loan-calculator">FHA-financed investments</a>.</p>

      <ol>
