      <div class="coc-info">
        📊 <strong><%= currentYear %> context:</strong> With mortgage rates at 7–7.5%, achieving 8%+ CoC requires buying in markets where the gross rent-to-price ratio (the "GRM") is favorable. Most analysis points to Midwest and South secondary markets — Cleveland, Memphis, Indianapolis, Cincinnati, Birmingham — as the best opportunities for positive cash flow in the current rate environment.
      </div>
    </section>

